{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "77382bd2c9f20aad0855ebce4306a85be36eed08dc58c756fb84ce1e50b67280", "ja": "まつりも、小さいころは、妹とふたりで\nお祭りに行ったのです。とっても楽しかったのです！", "zh": "茉莉小时候，也和妹妹两个人\n一起去过庙会呢。玩得超级开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "915a73b33b38c503a1dd8436a8e892f4e8093e3783b11f190e2580e104d821de", "ja": "そういえば、まつりは妹がおるんやったな。\n私も小さいころは、アニキと近所のお祭り行ったな～。", "zh": "说起来，原来茉莉还有个妹妹啊。\n我小时候也和哥哥一起去过附近的祭典呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d49e39ff890f83bb190b7ea62af8d5cc34a9d348c6adebbc4bc164ac48fc2db1", "ja": "お疲れ様！\n……みんな、なんだか楽しそうだな？", "zh": "辛苦了！\n……大家好像都很开心啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "c478a90a1334c5c4afad0c06fbb3526a1296f8bee45f02e77e404612f9a1b7a1", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、ナイスタイミング！\nあのね、なんか近くでお祭りやってるみたいだよ！", "zh": "{$P$}，来得正好！\n我跟你说哦，附近好像在办祭典呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "cc694278fe158d40dad97fb36bd9989ee2a92a3a40299ff1e5e02e6dd7ec8a6c", "ja": "大事なことだから、もう一回言うね！　近くで、\nお祭りやってるんだって～！　……チラッチラッ♪", "zh": "因为很重要，所以茜还要再说一次哦！附近\n好像在办祭典呢～！……瞄～瞄～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0497b8fa674692772053efb9374b3dc47bbebb0ce88f689558d254f59685d6b8", "ja": "へえ、そうなんだな！\nところでまつり、ちょっと話があるんだけど……。", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊！\n对了，まつり，我有件事想跟你说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "312e35e211c59fa69b4cfc98a4ea50d4e8f67050b4d4c62849cbecfa6338906d", "ja": "姫に？　{$P$}さん、\nそんなに改まって、何のお話なのです？", "zh": "找公主吗？{$P$}先生，\n这么正式，是有什么事情要说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1008_p", "source_sha256": "57e79f2b101d972a92719416162e82e0820873a3c806da429dbf6d341bbf0195", "ja": "実は、まつりの新曲を考えてるんだ。\n定期公演に合わせたいんだけど、お願いできるか？", "zh": "其实，我正在考虑茉莉的新曲。\n想配合定期公演推出，你能接下这份工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "051ee844b285902e52ee5dade0f2198d09ed35b28c02e2928d9fa068feed1bd6", "ja": "新曲……\nみらくる・わんだほー！なのです！", "zh": "新歌……\n奇迹·精彩绝伦！哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "b7450ad6873005626a8884b0f9cd686af05b758ce45c5ec8f158eeb614df9102", "ja": "もちろん、お願いされるのです♪\n次の公演は、どどーんと、姫におまかせなのです！", "zh": "当然要答应啦♪  \n下一场公演就轰轰烈烈地交给本公主吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "52263e4409c12fc53118c6b6bb3bc4c3dfe2fca57d2c53e79a9772bd9c70771c", "ja": "あっ、せや！　それやったら、まつりの妹を\n公演に呼んでみたらええんちゃう？", "zh": "啊，对了！那样的话，把小祭的妹妹叫来演出不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "417b8526f397b535468487cc664d97287d35e2a0891e685d196ecfe3147d4088", "ja": "ほ！？\n……奈緒ちゃん、それはどうしてなのです？", "zh": "哦！？\n……奈绪，那是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "33b96de86b3643b7803f3756ab5ab6d1dd6711befa32b81c17bf266060e2c1a8", "ja": "私の公演の時もな、アニキが観に来るってなって。\nお陰で、レッスンにめっちゃ気合いが入ってん！", "zh": "我公演那天也是，大哥说要来看。多亏了这个，我练习时可有干劲了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "7db44690efa921aebe2bf84476e73dc77493fc51bc245b3f6038d3d8c4abaf54", "ja": "なるほどなるほど～。妹ちゃんが観にくる……\nたしかに、気合いが入るかもしれないね！", "zh": "原来如此原来如此～妹妹要来看演出……确实会让人干劲十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "f2a068d708b5d79b5234052c705ae71ead43678da949c69015904f976fdb5941", "ja": "公演に……姫の、妹を……。", "zh": "演出公演时……让小公主的妹妹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "72a323845e2fda74279f56445e99eb00e7d3602fc695bc2b36cfaffcf5495450", "ja": "それは……\nそれはとっても、ぶらぼー！なアイディアなのです！", "zh": "那真是……\n真是非常棒的主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0a5f0861d59136017907c9f455f90f5c8564ab7919b3e159cd9c1b9ca2c23164", "ja": "まつり……いいのか？", "zh": "茉莉……这样好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "c99789ca9309962c8dad1f3f8f466ae80f0318889533a4ac65f1eb1da4f49df7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、変なことを聞くのです。\nまつりのステージは、誰でもうぇるかむ！なのですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生问了奇怪的话呢。\n茉莉的舞台，随时欢迎任何人哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "4e80c22719ad4bac7dee5af1d05e64518fc6426a01bc4aa84c391b6f633f4d1d", "ja": "それより、{$P$}さん。\n今度の新曲、姫にプロデュースさせてほしいのです！", "zh": "比起那个，{$P$}先生。\n这次的新歌，请让本公主来制作吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a0dd18a04336800e6772f831c5d9d61e60435a972015aa0dec0b4dc47e3df424", "ja": "新曲のプロデュースを？", "zh": "要制作新歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "540efa32ab5279eb17390744aab0278886d2b117c52e8547bde7994b067a33c2", "ja": "はいなのです！　まつりは、まつりの曲を聞いた人\nみんなが、はっぴー！になる曲を歌いたいのです♪", "zh": "是的！小祭想要唱一首能让所有听到小祭歌曲的人都变得幸福的歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d5b5742175d684a5ca5eb5b9dc1d29c16259c4baf5c91a5ae0cbfa2088c21a9a", "ja": "そうか……わかった。イメージがあるみたいだし、\n今回はまつりに任せてみよう。", "zh": "这样啊……知道了。既然你已经有想法，\n这次就交给茉莉试试吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "02fe0d619b8d8c0b98890876ee02f95e2315d8d6e08caa854563bc0b83ca9683", "ja": "ありがとうなのです、{$P$}さん！\nそれでは……奈緒ちゃん、茜ちゃん！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n那么……奈绪，小茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "7d90c3df37869337f3d8ceb063e161130a371154f4d37d263b44a40ebff8e8b2", "ja": "なに？／にゃっ？", "zh": "什么？／喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "c0252a5b4f0cc864f3e440413954bb4ac468bfe873d8a5048ae75a360fd88956", "ja": "にゃっ？", "zh": "喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "fa5a375f969116304d2d4754252bfac598eb7da0043aa17d97f00d945e771a09", "ja": "ふたりには、姫のお手伝いをお願いするのです！\n姫の新曲のために、力を貸してほしいのです～。", "zh": "希望你们两位来帮公主的忙！\n为了公主的新歌，希望你们能助我一臂之力～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "0d2571850952192309168ec56321baf1d6a92296ae56b1eabc037810564ff2a6", "ja": "何や、水くさいな、まつり！\nそんな面白そうなこと、こっちから立候補したるわ！", "zh": "什么嘛，真见外啊，茉莉！这种听起来就很有意思的事，我主动报名就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "a369aa4b9346c6e5eb36d53d9278781cad16dbf29065a7e0b12c2705f64d43e1", "ja": "そうそう！　大天才美少女・茜ちゃんにおまかせ！\n大船に乗ったつもりで、頼ってくれていいよ♪", "zh": "对对！就交给大天才美少女·小茜吧！\n尽管放心依靠我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1030_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "8dc6f7418d42ec191043b34974cb32a53dd01622a47e02a976bd89aff83be8fb", "ja": "お疲れさまです。{$P$}は……\nあ、ここにいたんですね。ミーティング中ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了。{$P$}是……\n啊，原来您在这里。正在开会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "1edd5be268739b4ff6ddfbfaf170a7e7b3cafe515eb6d9497298746df16d6bb5", "ja": "お疲れさまです。あの、{$P$}さん！\nみなさんも、お時間ありますか？", "zh": "辛苦了。那个，{$P$}先生！大家也有时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "1c2ea9043bcb7ce530c02ae68470f2f88e09fc2018cab38c4d4da6e61c96be21", "ja": "お疲れ～って、千早と百合子？\n珍しい組み合わせやな、何かあったん？", "zh": "辛苦啦——咦，千早和百合子？\n真是少见的组合呀，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "d4ec148e583f440bbf40eea9f43d88b5d0b252907e5514642a2ca2cd309f6924", "ja": "はい！　さっき劇場に来る途中、チラシをもらって。\n今日、近くで縁日をやっているんだそうです！", "zh": "是的！刚才来剧场的路上，我拿到了一张传单。\n听说今天附近要举办庙会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1035_p", "source_sha256": "4aec7ca278406a26b5d7bf1c2799f2f0cf5f1f08bd4c6b7603745bb45abbb053", "ja": "ああ、さっき茜が言ってたやつだな。\nそれで、みんなを誘いに来たのか？", "zh": "啊，就是刚才茜提到的那个吧。\n所以你是来邀请大家的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1036_002chi", "source_sha256": "1ddea98312b3d2fd37eede8a6e000fa8539f7ebd2ddc4efecbe53a5171b80af4", "ja": "催し物の中に、歌のステージもあるみたいなので。\nせっかくなので、見学してみようかと思って……。", "zh": "听说活动中好像也有歌唱舞台。\n难得有这个机会，我想去参观一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1037_002chi", "source_sha256": "59afdae0c4d460ccbd3f21f1806d8ce761c452cde67be07d514630a27b3e1268", "ja": "時間があるなら、みんなでどうでしょう。\n{$P$}も一緒に。", "zh": "如果有时间的话，大家一起去怎么样。\n{$P$}也一起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "bafab1cdb4f91bf869b517e4c5ae4a28b07550281980fef5609ebd9b32d016a6", "ja": "もちろん、茜ちゃんは行くよ！\n{$P$}ちゃん、いいよね？　ねっ？", "zh": "当然要去，小茜！\n{$P$}，可以吧？对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "3906c61940aa7fc57e0bae8bb37ff328ad2af946842fc85c9dbd33e0c8b12f1d", "ja": "私も行く！\nまつりも行くやろ？", "zh": "我也去！小祭也一起去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1040_021mat", "source_sha256": "e30444ddfcca6fd82ff928ef21ac0b43bffb9b509505e3d9721aa8ed66e43d5a", "ja": "はいほー！　当然、姫も一緒に行くのです！\nなんだか、はっぴー！の予感がするのです。", "zh": "嗨哟——！当然，公主也要一起去呀！\n总觉得，好像会有开心的事发生呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1041_021mat", "source_sha256": "9c73492010a58e7452d35c90217978b68ab8395db00b4c45febeba4581fff73d", "ja": "それに、姫の新曲のアイディア探しに、\nお祭り会場はなんだかうってつけな気がするのです♪", "zh": "而且，祭典会场好像很适合寻找公主新歌的灵感呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_088_1042_p", "source_sha256": "674b9faf596ddc571126b99848e69523a08e44fef06ae93bf74a18c71f95ef21", "ja": "そうか。\nよし、みんなで行ってみようか！", "zh": "这样啊。\n好，那就一起去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
